This repository contains and adapts material from the OpenProposal
Specification by IAB Tech Lab, licensed under CC BY 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/): the specification text and its
examples, which the schemas, rules, decision records, IR, and SDK types quote
and adapt. spec-input/snapshots/with-open-prs/ merges open pull requests into
it; the lock and spec-input/INTEGRATION*.md record every change. This is an
independent work, not a product of IAB Tech Lab, and it implies no endorsement.

kernel/lists.yaml reproduces code lists from AdCOM 1.0 by IAB Tech Lab
(CC BY 3.0): API frameworks, playback methods, and video placement subtypes.

kernel/lists.yaml also lists the zone names of the IANA Time Zone Database
(tzdata), which is in the public domain.

kernel/sources/iso-4217-list-one-2026-09-17.xml is ISO 4217 List One as
published by SIX Financial Information AG for the ISO 4217 Maintenance Agency,
reproduced unmodified so its SHA-256 can be verified, and kernel/lists.yaml
lists its currency codes. ISO 4217 is (c) ISO.

test/fixtures/seller-agent-payloads.json holds eleven proposal payloads produced
by the OpenProposal mapper of IAB Tech Lab's seller agent
(https://github.com/IABTechLab/seller-agent, branch feat/openproposal-mapping
at e77022e), licensed under the Apache License 2.0. They are test inputs only,
reproduced unmodified.
